@startuml 02-containers
title Agent Memory — Containers
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Client surfaces" {
  [agent-memory / am CLI\n(Go, cobra)] as CLI
  [TUI\n(bubbletea)] as TUI
  [MCP stdio adapter\n(Node server.js)] as MCP
  [IDE hooks\n(Claude listen, PreToolUse)] as Hooks
  [Dashboard SPA\n(React + Mantine)] as Dash
  [macOS menubar\n(Swift)] as Menubar
  [Go SDK\n(sdk/go/agentmemory)] as SDK
}

node "agent-memory serve  127.0.0.1:3211" {
  [HTTP API\n/api/v1, /health, /metrics] as API
  [Application services] as App
  [Memory engine\n(retrieval, write, lifecycle)] as Engine
  [Jev harness\n(runs, context, models, tools, approvals)] as Harness
  [Scheduler\n(background maintenance)] as Sched
}

package "~~/.agent-memory" {
  database "Per-workspace\nSQLite DB" as DB
  file "workspaces.json\nregistry" as Reg
  file "Markdown tier\n(managed rule files)" as MD
  file "harness/runs, harness/idem" as RunStore
  file "Private credential\nstore (Jev token)" as Cred
}

[GraphRAG adapter\n(Python, pinned graphrag 3.1.2)] as GR

CLI --> API
CLI --> Engine : local-only commands
TUI --> API
MCP --> API : HTTP only,\nno CLI fallback
Hooks --> API
Dash --> API
SDK --> API
Menubar --> CLI
API --> App
API --> Harness
App --> Engine
Sched --> Engine
Engine --> DB
Engine --> MD
App --> Reg
Harness --> RunStore
Harness --> Cred
Harness --> DB : memory / solution context
App --> GR : index jobs,\nartifact import
@enduml
